WEBVTT

00:08:58.951 --> 00:09:02.538
and punish it for its sheer size.

00:09:03.747 --> 00:09:07.960
Meanwhile, an informal poll
of the Gen Zers in my life

00:09:08.002 --> 00:09:11.088
informs me that Facebook is "cringe."

00:09:11.130 --> 00:09:13.507
(Laughter)

00:09:13.549 --> 00:09:16.010
TikTok is eating Facebook’s lunch,

00:09:16.010 --> 00:09:20.889
and the first-quarter earnings report
of Meta came with a surprise.

00:09:20.931 --> 00:09:22.391
The market cap of the firm

00:09:22.433 --> 00:09:26.520
had actually dropped
below the level written into that bill

00:09:26.520 --> 00:09:29.732
to punish firms for being too big.